## 2. Comprehensive System Guardrails Setup

Our system implements a **4-Tier Safety Guardrail Architecture**:

```text
 ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │                                 SYSTEM GUARDRAILS SETUP                                  │
 ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │                                                                                          │
 │ 1. DOSAGE ALTERATION SAFETY GUARDRAIL (`context_agent.py`):                              │
 │    • Const: `GUARDRAIL_DISCLAIMER`                                                       │
 │    • Intercepts unsafe user requests (e.g. "double dose", "increase pills", "stop med")  │
 │    • Hard Stop: "I cannot alter your prescribed medication dosage. Please consult        │
 │      Dr. Prescribing Doctor directly for any medication changes."                         │
 │                                                                                          │
 │ 2. EMERGENCY RED-FLAG TRIAGE GUARDRAIL (`chatbot.py` & `emergency_agent.py`):            │
 │    • Intercepts severe symptoms (chest pain, breathlessness, heavy bleeding, stroke)     │
 │    • Hard Stop: Immediately bypasses conversational chat and opens 24/7 ER Dispatch      │
 │      with live Haversine travel time to KMCH / Ganga Hospital.                           │
 │                                                                                          │
 │ 3. NON-HALLUCINATION DIAGNOSIS GUARDRAIL (`prescription_parser.py`):                     │
 │    • Pydantic Constraint: `"recordedDiagnosis": "Explicitly stated diagnosis ONLY."`     │
 │    • Strictly forbids LLMs from inferring or inventing unstated medical conditions.       │
 │                                                                                          │
 │ 4. DATA ISOLATION & CONSENT GUARDRAIL (`database.py` & `ConsentGrantDB`):                │
 │    • Enforces access scope (`full`, `meds_only`, `nothing`) before returning patient     │
 │      timeline records to third-party doctors.                                            │
 └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

